        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>[1.1.1] - 2026-06-19</h2>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Reject invalid value arithmetic in asset aggregation (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4695522176" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/784" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/784/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/784">#784</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔧 Continuous Integration</h3>
<ul>
<li>Publish to crates.io with --isolated to override publish=false (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4621789566" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/782" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/782/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/782">#782</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network2)</em> Fix flaky full_protocol_flow test by removing redundant Housekeeping (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4520151819" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/780" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/780/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/780">#780</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Release v1.1.1</li>
</ul>
</div>
