        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>[1.1.0] - 2026-05-29</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network)</em> Move DMQ message id out of the payload (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4430385510" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/776" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/776/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/776">#776</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(ledger)</em> Correct inverted native script timelock comparisons (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4495667147" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/778" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/778/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/778">#778</a>)</li>
<li>Make serde a non-optional dependency of pallas-primitives (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4495971372" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/779" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/779/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/779">#779</a>)</li>
</ul>
</div>
