        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>[1.0.0] - 2026-05-11</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Add v1beta spec support alongside v1alpha (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4368830979" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/745" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/745/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/745">#745</a>)</li>
<li>Prep for van Rossem hard fork (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4372973780" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/747" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/747/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/747">#747</a>)</li>
<li>Bump rust edition to 2024 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4421807538" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/770" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/770/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/770">#770</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Forward v1alpha/v1beta service features from utxorpc-spec (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4369087473" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/746" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/746/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/746">#746</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Include withdrawals in conway redeemer pointer check (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4408580094" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/761" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/761/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/761">#761</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Support multiple Plutus language cost models in script data (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4408818294" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/763" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/763/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/763">#763</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Extract phase2 evaluator and surface failure context (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4378133919" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/751" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/751/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/751">#751</a>)</li>
<li><em>(math)</em> Remove Inconsequential Constant trait (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3899055200" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/728" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/728/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/728">#728</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tidy per-crate READMEs onto a common structure (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4406340314" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/759" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/759/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/759">#759</a>)</li>
<li>Improve root readme (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4406563180" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/760" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/760/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/760">#760</a>)</li>
<li>Add missing docstrings across the board (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4421552148" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/769" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/769/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/769">#769</a>)</li>
<li>Use permalinks for examples in docstrings</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔧 Continuous Integration</h3>
<ul>
<li>Improve github workflow</li>
<li>Switch release workflow to cargo-release split flow (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4416293710" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/768" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/768/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/768">#768</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network2)</em> Add new tcp-level benches (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4187502459" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/736" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/736/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/736">#736</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fix clippy warnings across workspace (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4376012438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/748" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/748/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/748">#748</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Switch from txpipe uplc-turbo fork to pragma-org amaru-uplc (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4376326147" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/749" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/749/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/749">#749</a>)</li>
<li>Fix lints, rustdoc, and feature gates across workspace (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4415737252" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/764" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/764/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/764">#764</a>)</li>
<li>Declare MSRV (1.88) and verify in CI (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4415778950" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/765" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/765/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/765">#765</a>)</li>
<li>Hoist common cargo metadata and dependencies to workspace (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4415933863" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/766" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/766/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/766">#766</a>)</li>
<li>Replace git-chglog automation with git-cliff (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4416012293" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/767" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/767/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/767">#767</a>)</li>
<li>Don't release example crates</li>
<li>Release v1.0.0</li>
</ul>
<h3>Build</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(deps)</em> Update binary-layout requirement from 3.2.0 to 4.0.2 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2244165315" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/435" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/435/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/435">#435</a>)</li>
<li><em>(deps)</em> Update bech32 requirement from 0.9.1 to 0.11.1 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4338701510" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/744" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/744/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/744">#744</a>)</li>
<li><em>(deps)</em> Update thiserror requirement from 1.0.39 to 2.0.18 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4338696777" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/743" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/743/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/743">#743</a>)</li>
<li><em>(deps)</em> Update socket2 requirement from 0.5.5 to 0.6.3 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4338694047" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/741" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/741/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/741">#741</a>)</li>
<li><em>(deps)</em> Update rand requirement from 0.8.5 to 0.10.1 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4338694750" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/742" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/742/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/742">#742</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Hore</h3>
<ul>
<li>Move git-cliff hook to single location</li>
</ul>
<h2>[1.0.0-alpha.6] - 2026-03-30</h2>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Treat empty multiasset values as equal to coin values (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4084704779" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/733" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/733/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/733">#733</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network2)</em> Ensure docstring coverage and visibility on docs.rs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4160130287" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/734" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/734/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/734">#734</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network2)</em> Improve error case coverage (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4165586047" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/735" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/735/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/735">#735</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Publish network2 crate</li>
</ul>
<h2>[1.0.0-alpha.5] - 2026-02-28</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network)</em> Introduce responder behavior (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4004477906" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/732" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/732/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/732">#732</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Handle non-conway utxos in conway txs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3933215212" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/729" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/729/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/729">#729</a>)</li>
<li><em>(codec)</em> Calculate length of encoded array (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3057057476" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/654" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/654/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/654">#654</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>[1.0.0-alpha.4] - 2026-02-04</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(network)</em> Add data type derives required by downstream libs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3663583120" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/714" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/714/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/714">#714</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Introduce relaxed hash decoding flag (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3648721650" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/713" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/713/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/713">#713</a>)</li>
<li><em>(traverse)</em> Don't concatenate hash and index when sorting tx inputs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3872909192" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/724" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/724/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/724">#724</a>)</li>
<li><em>(hardano)</em> Preserve order on cost models config parsing (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3882324886" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/726" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/726/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/726">#726</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Incomplete CBOR support for DMQ local submission rejection (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3876573703" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/725" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/725/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/725">#725</a>)</li>
<li><em>(configs)</em> Ensure shelley devnet config parses correctly (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3618710806" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/710" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/710/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/710">#710</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(math)</em> Clean up fmt (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3758874033" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/721" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/721/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/721">#721</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(interop)</em> Bump utxorpc version to 0.18.1 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3700548662" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/716" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/716/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/716">#716</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>[1.0.0-alpha.3] - 2025-11-18</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
