<li><em>(network)</em> Finish remaining variants for local-tx-submit codec (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2854422157" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/602" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/602/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/602">#602</a>)</li>
<li><em>(codec)</em> Allow KeepRaw to own its data (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2854401360" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/601" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/601/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/601">#601</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Add catch-all mechanism for unknown cost models (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2842104021" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/596" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/596/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/596">#596</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Introduce new crate with phase-1 and phase-2 validation (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2862042333" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/607" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/607/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/607">#607</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Expose has_agency method for public access (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2888200100" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/614" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/614/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/614">#614</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Implement codec for local-submit errors (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2876469742" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/609" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/609/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/609">#609</a>)</li>
<li><em>(hardano)</em> New error display output that matches Haskell submit errors (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2902383104" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/623" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/623/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/623">#623</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Update peersharing codec to match n2n protocol v14 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2904095726" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/626" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/626/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/626">#626</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Add missing mappings for pparams (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2762496952" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/571" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/571/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/571">#571</a>)</li>
<li><em>(interop)</em> Add Plutus V3 cost model in u5c mapper (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2763215440" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/572" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/572/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/572">#572</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Fix IntersectNotFound CBOR encoding (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2777317021" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/575" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/575/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/575">#575</a>)</li>
<li><em>(configs)</em> Fix Shelley genesis parsing (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2786711763" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/577" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/577/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/577">#577</a>)</li>
<li><em>(interop)</em> Update u5c snapshot test to match new features (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2792525948" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/579" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/579/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/579">#579</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Fix codec of peersharing peer address (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2830179141" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/589" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/589/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/589">#589</a>)</li>
<li><em>(network)</em> Fix rejection reason decoding (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2679893936" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/548" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/548/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/548">#548</a>)</li>
<li>Fix error on Conway TX validation (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2858976599" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/603" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/603/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/603">#603</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Make conway tests pass (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2904463499" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/627" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/627/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/627">#627</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Support validation of Shelley UTxO (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2989852045" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/643" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/643/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/643">#643</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li>Reduce codec boilerplate (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2863230563" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/608" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/608/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/608">#608</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Simplify api by removing roundtrip-safe cbor artifacts (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2881482759" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/611" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/611/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/611">#611</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Remove unnecessary Conway codecs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2938228843" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/630" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/630/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/630">#630</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Remove Pseudo structs from Alonzo primitives (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2939078875" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/631" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/631/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/631">#631</a>)</li>
<li><em>(txbuilder)</em> Make some useful structs public  (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2956367695" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/634" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/634/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/634">#634</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Apply changes in primitives structs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2949745166" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/633" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/633/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/633">#633</a>)</li>
<li><em>(validate)</em> Rename modules and feature flags (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2963820586" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/637" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/637/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/637">#637</a>)</li>
<li><em>(primitives)</em> Avoid pseudo structs in favor of KeepRaw (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2947643244" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/632" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/632/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/632">#632</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fix lint warnings (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2795337818" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/582" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/582/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/582">#582</a>)</li>
<li>Cleanup dead dependencies (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2900057029" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/615" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/615/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/615">#615</a>)</li>
<li>Fix lint warnings (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2900239696" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/616" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/616/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/616">#616</a>)</li>
<li>Impl PartialEq,Eq for chainsync Tip (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2956448160" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/635" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/635/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/635">#635</a>)</li>
<li>Fix incorrect link in crate metadata (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2937420908" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/629" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/629/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/629">#629</a>)</li>
<li>Fix lint warnings (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2977991407" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/640" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/640/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/pull/640">#640</a>)</li>
</ul>
</div>
