        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2><a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.2...v0.18.5">v0.18.5</a> (2025-06-23)</h2>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>include n2n handshake version 14 (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/663/hovercard">#663</a>)</li>
<li>update n2n version table (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/530" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/530/hovercard">#530</a>)</li>
<li>use u64 instead of i64 for unit interval and rational numerator (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/268" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/268/hovercard">#268</a>)</li>
<li><strong>network:</strong> retrofit support for protocol version 12 (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/625" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/625/hovercard">#625</a>)</li>
<li><strong>primitives:</strong> Handle U8 and U16 in value serialization</li>
</ul>
<h2>Contributors</h2>
<p><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/paulobressan/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/paulobressan">@paulobressan</a></p></div>
</div>
