        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2><a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.1...v1.0.0-alpha.2">v1.0.0-alpha.2</a> (2025-05-02)</h2>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Separate PParamsUpdate from ProtocolParam (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/648" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/648/hovercard">#648</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Code Refactoring</h3>
<ul>
<li>move script data hash to primitives (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/652" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/652/hovercard">#652</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Test</h3>
<ul>
<li>use HTTPS url for cardano-blueprint submodule (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/651/hovercard">#651</a>)</li>
<li>fix i64 failing conversions (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/650" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/650/hovercard">#650</a>)</li>
<li>introduce Cardano Blueprint tests (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/638" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/638/hovercard">#638</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Chore</h3>
<ul>
<li>deprecate pallas wallet crate (<a href="https://github.com/txpipe/pallas/issues/649" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/pallas/pull/649/hovercard">#649</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Contributors</h2>
<p><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/SupernaviX/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/SupernaviX">@SupernaviX</a> <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ch1bo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ch1bo">@ch1bo</a> <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/logicalmechanism/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/logicalmechanism">@logicalmechanism</a> <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/scarmuega/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/scarmuega">@scarmuega</a></p></div>
